# agent-substrate-kit local artifacts
.substrate/state/

# Impeccable's live-server runtime state: a pid, a port and a session token for a server that
# exists only while a critique is running. Machine-local, stale the moment it is written, and it
# carries a token. The critique SNAPSHOTS under .impeccable/critique/ are committed on purpose.
.impeccable/live/
.venv/
__pycache__/

# generated artifacts (regenerated by manage.sh setup / coverage runs)
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/

# Built TechCraft handout PDFs — reproduce with docs/generators/*.py.
# The generators write to the working directory, which is normally the repo root, so both
# locations are covered; a committed PDF would immediately be a stale second copy of a document
# whose whole point is that it is generated from validated claims.
docs/generators/*.pdf
/techcraft-integration-contract.pdf
/techcraft-deployment-guide.pdf

# handoff packages
dist/
